                "text": "Honored to break ground on CAMC Greenbrier Valley Medical Center! \n\nWhen I was Governor, I made sure our rural hospitals had the resources to thrive. \n\nAs Senator, I pushed for rural healthcare to be included in the Big Beautiful Bill\u2014because that same fight still matters. https://t.co/D8XV5fInZ6",
