                "text": "Another win for West Virginia! \n\nIn January, I met with the incredible team at CAMC and proudly supported the Vandalia Health Neuroscience Institute with a $5M investment. \n\nThe facility will be home to world-class care for our communities, and I\u2019m proud to see it moving along.",
